<title>UK: SocGen sets 1.5 billion FRF perpetual notes issue.</title>
<headline>SocGen sets 1.5 billion FRF perpetual notes issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale on Thursday said it was lead managing for itself a 1.5 billion French franc perpetual callable notes issue in the domestic market.</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	SPREAD     +68 BP    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER TO YIELD 10-YEAR OAT +68 BP.</p>
<p>	     *PAYS PIBOR PLUS 200 BP AFTER 10 YEARS IF NOT CALLED.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
